          "description": "by Charles Major. LibriVox v1 read by Tanica. Set in 1820's Indiana, this delightful story is the tale of young Balser Brent, who has a knack for running into bears. Usually the bears come out of the interaction worse than the feisty and brave Balser. A great story for both boys and girls who enjoy adventure and excitement. ",
